# =============================================================================
# ML Pipeline — Infisical Bootstrap Secrets
# =============================================================================
# Copy this file to secrets.env (gitignored), fill in any values that need
# changing, then run:
#
#   ./infisical/bootstrap.sh
#
# All keys live in a single flat path "/" in the "prod" environment.
# Every InfisicalSecret CRD syncs the full set; each service reads only
# the keys it needs via secretKeyRef / envFrom.
# =============================================================================

